{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"sase-16g:000001:issue_created:sase-16g:40c306519990b8807826b693fc9fc4f7967dd3e63200fb3e08d76cb48dffd1a6","timestamp":"2026-09-22T16:59:04Z","actor":"bbugyi200.athena.0pe","operation":"issue_created","issue_id":"sase-16g","payload":{"kind":"issue_created","issue":{"id":"sase-16g","title":"Service supervision P0: honest restarts, loud failures, safe config and environment","status":"open","issue_type":"plan","tier":"epic","parent_id":null,"owner":"bryanbugyi34@gmail.com","assignee":"","created_at":"2026-09-22T16:59:04Z","created_by":"bbugyi200.athena.0pe","updated_at":"2026-09-22T16:59:04Z","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"description":"The service host obeys its own restart decisions, an explicit restart is a confirmed transition with a new pid, every failure is visible in a notification, the CLI, and the Services tab, a broken config layer never silently stops a proc, and `sase service init` cannot freeze an agent shell's feature flags into the 24/7 host.","design":"plan:202609/services_p0_supervision.md","model":"","is_ready_to_work":false,"changespec_name":"","changespec_bug_id":"","dependencies":[]}}}
